hborhoods: East Market, Bayview, and North Pier. East Market has the main transit depot. Bayview contains Bayview Hospital and several senior housing blocks. North Pier contains the largest public shelter and a low-lying pump station. The program treats these neighborhoods as one connected service zone rather than three separate projects.\n######################\nOutput:'}
